ms.criteria:
for the Identity App:
・A DID can be issued
・a VC can be issued
・a VC can be verified

for the DID Wallet:
・its owner can prove (via signature) that he/she owns other wallets
・its owner can request a DID issuance to the Identity App
・its owner can request issuance of a VC (which will contain proof required for voting and acting as voting power)

for the verifier (at this stage Postman calls, but in later milestones, the voting App) 
・No Personal Identifiable Information can be accessed by any third party requesting a VC verification
